wer the companies that move money, we do not compete with them. We are scaling globally, with a sharp focus on Europe and the United States.\\n The opportunity\\n We are opening a new growth channel: a global partner ecosystem of companies that already sit close to our ICP and can open doors we cannot open alone. Core banking vendors, ERP and TMS providers, payment platforms, fintech enablers, technology integrators, and consulting firms.\\nThis is a first-hire, single-contributor role. You will build the channel from zero, sign the partners, activate them, and run the relationships that turn them into a steady source of qualified opportunities. You will report directly to the CEO and own a function, not a slot in one.\\n What You Will Do\\n Identify and engage target partners globally, with a focus on Europe and the United States.\\n Run the full partner cycle: outreach, qualification, negotiation, and signing.\\n Activate partners with the right materials, enablement, and rhythm so they refer real opportunities, not goodwill.\\n Manage the ongoing relationship: regular touchpoints, joint planning, and quarterly business reviews.\\n Hand off qualified leads to Okoora's sales teams and stay close through to deal close.\\n Report partner health, pipeline contribution, and revenue impact directly to the CEO.\\n Who You Are\\n At least 3 years in channel partnerships, partner development, or strategic alliances within B2B fintech, payments, banking technology, ERP, TMS, or SaaS infrastructure.\\n You have built a partner pipeline from zero before. You know the difference between a logo on a slide and a partner who actually delivers.\\n You operate as a heavy daily user of AI tools. You build your own leverage with agents, automated research, outreach workflows, and content production. You do not visit AI, you live there.\\n You are equally strong as a hunter and as a nurturer. Both sides of the role are non-negotiable.\\n You are self-directed, comfortable with full ownership, and do not need to be managed in the day to day.\\n Your business English is native or near native.\\n Nice to have\\n Additional business languages, particularly German, French, or Spanish.\\n An existing network across core banking, ERP, TMS, payments, or fintech ecosystems.\\n Direct experience operating across European and US markets.\\n What We Offer\\n A category-defining position to sell from: infrastructure, not another PSP.\\n Direct ownership of a global function from day one.\\n A short reporting line to the CEO and high visibility across the company.\\n Base salary plus a performance-based bonus tied to real revenue from the partner channel.\",\"requirements\":[\"Identify and engage target partners globally, with a focus on Europe and the United States.\",\"Run the full partner cycle: outreach, qualification, negotiation, and signing.\",\"Activate partners with the right materials, enablement, and rhythm so they refer real opportunities, not goodwill.\",\"Manage the ongoing relationship: regular touchpoints, joint planning, and quarterly business reviews.\",\"Hand off qualified leads to Okoora's sales teams and stay close through to deal close.\",\"Report partner health, pipeline contribution, and revenue impact directly to the CEO.\",\"At least 3 years in channel partnerships, partner development, or strategic alliances within B2B fintech, payments, banking technology, ERP, TMS, or SaaS infrastructure.\",\"You have built a partner pipeline from zero before. You know the difference between a logo on a slide and a partner who actually delivers.\",\"You operate as a heavy daily user of AI tools. You build your own leverage with agents, automated research, outreach workflows, and content production. You do not visit AI, you live there.\",\"You are equally strong as a hunter and as a nurturer. Both sides of the role are non-negotiable.\",\"You are self-directed, comfortable with full ownership, and do not need to be managed in the day to day.\",\"Your business English is native or near native.\"],\"fit\":{\"yearsRequired\":3,\"yearsMet\":true,\"yearsHave\":15,\"global\":true,\"domains\":[\"partnerships\",\"partner\",\"alliance\",\"channel\",\"growth\",\"saas\",\"b2b\",\"revenue\"],\"senior\":true,\"score\":7,\"verdict\":\"גבוהה\"},\"sendStatus\":\"blocked\",\"sendStatusAt\":\"2026-06-22T05:48:18.299Z\",\"cvFeedback\":null,\"relevanceNote\":null,\"summaryHe\":\"תפקיד first-hire של תורם יחיד שבונה ערוץ שותפים מאפס מול בנקים, ERP, פלטפורמות תשלום ואינטגרטורים. מחזור שותף מלא: גיוס, חתימה, הפעלה וניהול. דיווח ישיר ל-CEO.\",\"companyHe\":\"Okoora היא שכבת תשתית FX משובצת לבנקים, נאו-בנקים, מערכות ERP ו-TMS, פלטפורמות תשלום ופינטקים. מתרחבת גלובלית בדגש על אירופה וארצות הברית.\",\"cvFixed\":false,\"cvFixedAt\":null,\"letter\":{\"file\":\"/pdfs/Elia Ben Cnaan - Cover Letter - Okoora - Head of Channel Partnerships.pdf\",\"downloadName\":\"Elia Ben Cnaan - Cover Letter - Okoora - Head of Channel Partnerships.pdf\"}},{\"id\":\"li-4435031959\",\"source\":\"linkedin\",\"role\":\"Alliances & Partnerships Lead (AWS)\",\"company\":\"Jobgether\",\"url\":\"https://il.linkedin.com/jobs/view/alliances-partnerships-lead-aws-at-jobgether-4435031959\",\"archetype\":\"strategic-partnerships\",\"cv\":{\"id\":\"kissterra-strategic\",\"name\":\"Jobgether - Alliances & Partnerships Lead (AWS)\",\"file\":\"/pdfs/Elia Ben Cnaan - Jobgether - Alliances & Partnerships Lead (AWS).pdf\",\"score\":6,\"reasons\":[\"partnerships\",\"alliances\"],\"sourceFile\":\"/pdfs/Elia-Ben-Cnaan-CV-Kissterra-Strategic-Partnerships.pdf\",\"downloadName\":\"Elia Ben Cnaan - Jobgether - Alliances & Partnerships Lead (AWS).pdf\"},\"alternativeCvs\":[{\"id\":\"atera-alliances\",\"display\":\"Atera — Alliances\",\"file\":\"/pdfs/Elia-Ben-Cnaan-CV-Atera-Alliances.pdf\",\"score\":4},{\"id\":\"appsflyer-partner\",\"display\":\"AppsFlyer — Partnerships\",\"file\":\"/pdfs/Elia-Ben-Cnaan-CV-AppsFlyer-Partner.pdf\",\"score\":3}],\"coverLetter\":\"Hi,\\n\\nI came across the Alliances & Partnerships Lead (AWS) role at Jobgether and it maps directly to what I do: business development, growth and strategic partnerships, with 15+ years building partnerships and revenue channels from scratch across SaaS and enterprise.\\n\\nI'd love to show how my experience can contribute to Jobgether. My CV is attached.\\n\\nBest,\\nElia Ben Cnaan\",\"contact\":null,\"contactNeeded\":true,\"status\":\"needs-contact\",\"preparedAt\":\"2026-07-06T02:01:09.009Z\",\"descriptionText\":\"This position is listed on behalf of a partner company, who manages all applications and next steps. Our partner is looking for a Alliances & Partnerships Lead (AWS) based in Israel.\\n This role sits at the heart of a high-growth AI consultancy operating within the AWS ecosystem, where you will be responsible for driving strategic partnerships and turning ecosystem relationships into a consistent pipeline of enterprise opportunities. You will build and maintain strong connections with AWS account managers, partner development teams, and solution architects across multiple regions. A core part of your mission is to position AI and cloud consulting capabilities in a way that resonates with both technical and business stakeholders. You will own the full commercial lifecycle—from first conversation and co-sell alignment through to proposal, negotiation, and contract closure. Working closely with technical teams, you will translate complex AI solutions into credible, value-driven offerings. This is a highly visible role with direct impact on revenue growth, partner positioning, and long-term strategic expansion within the AWS ecosystem. It is ideal for someone who thrives at the intersection of technology, relationships, and enterprise sales execution.\\nAccountabilities\\n Own the full commercial and partnership sales cycle, from AWS ecosystem relationship building through to deal closure and post-sale account growth.\\n Develop and expand strategic relationships with AWS accou